Added 285 net-new static landing pages, all aimed at high-intent
long-tail Bangalore real-estate queries.

- /compare/<a>-vs-<b>.html × 153 — side-by-side compare for the 18
  most-searched localities (Whitefield, Sarjapur Road, HSR, Indiranagar,
  Hebbal, Yelahanka, Electronic City, etc.). Each: price / CAGR / yield
  / livability / cauvery winner table, narrative verdict, links to both
  locality profiles. FAQPage + BreadcrumbList JSON-LD.
- /builders/<slug>.html × 35 + /builders/ hub — one per tier-1 builder
  (Prestige, Brigade, Sobha, Godrej, Puravankara, Sattva, Embassy, Birla,
  Total Environment, Assetz, Mahindra, Tata, L&T, Shriram, Adarsh,
  Casagrand, Lodha, Kolte-Patil, Sumadhura, Nambiar, Concorde, Arvind,
  Goyal & Co, Vaishnavi, SNN, Mahaveer, Modern Spaaces, Bhartiya,
  DivyaSree, Ramky, MJR, Shapoorji, Radiance, Mana, Century) with
  full project list, stage mix, locality footprint. Organisation +
  BreadcrumbList JSON-LD.
- /launches/<stage>-in-<locality>.html × 91 + /launches/<stage>.html × 3
  + /launches/ index — every (Launched / Pre-launch / Under-construction)
  × (locality with ≥1 project) combination. High-intent queries like
  "pre-launches in Devanahalli", "under construction Hebbal".

Per-locality enhancements (/l/<slug>.html × 127):
- 4 inline FAQs answered from the locality's own data (price, Cauvery
  status, yield, growth since 2019) with FAQPage JSON-LD so each page
  is eligible for FAQ rich-snippets.
- Lightweight inline SVG price-history sparkline (2019–2029) — no
  Chart.js, no JS, fast LCP, indexable.

Discovery:
- sitemap.xml regenerated: 585 URLs (was 300). Now includes compare,
  builders, launches, sparkline-enhanced locality pages.
- IndexNow: a8c4...c6a.txt key file + scripts/indexnow.sh helper that
  POSTs every sitemap URL to Bing/Yandex IndexNow API. Run after each
  deploy for sub-hour indexing on Bing.
